## The torque of a magnetic dipole in the local field, transcribed from adcs-sim run.rs (the coils' torque m x B on the
## plant, and the held dipole's under soft OILS): tau = m x B (Wertz 1978, Spacecraft Attitude Determination and
## Control, eq. 17-48). Body frame; m [A m^2], B [T], tau [N m].
## The developer's transcription (S7.7), unsigned.
module coiltorque

## The torque [N m] of the body dipole m [A m^2] in the body field b [T].
fn coil_torque(m: real[1][3] in -1 .. 1, b: real[1][3] in -6e-5 .. 6e-5) -> tau: real[1][3]
    tau = cross(m, b)
end
